abstract: >-
  A manuscript deriving a mass gap for lattice gauge theory over every
  compact simple group, constructively over the positive naturals, together
  with its Lean 4 formalization: two libraries, MassGap and MassGapChecks,
  Lean core alone, every declaration at the empty axiom set and every check
  module decided by the kernel.  The manuscript is a nominally complete
  proof, to the extent that any proof reviewed only by its author can be
  considered complete; any change, significant or minor, is made in the TeX
  first and reflected in Lean.  The Lean tree is a mostly complete
  transcription of the TeX proof, and the README states exactly which
  clauses of the main theorem it holds at this version and which remain
  open.
